    "ix.21": "Westward expansion & its political, economic, and social effects — Surface jigsaw, Deep map, Transfer brief",
    "ix.22": "Factors leading to the growth of sectionalism — Deep concept map, Transfer debrief",
    "ix.23": "Location & physical characteristics of the U.S. and how geography shaped expansion — Surface map/data work",
    "ix.24": "Why sections developed different economic systems — Deep concept map",
